## API Endpoints

### Priority 1 (Week 1)
- GET `/health` - Health check
- POST `/internal/chat/generate` - Generate avatar response (LangChain + LangSmith)

### Priority 2 (Week 2)
- POST `/internal/chat/stream` - Stream response (LangChain streaming)
- GET `/internal/memory/{user_id}` - Get user memory
- DELETE `/internal/memory/{user_id}` - Delete memory (GDPR)
- POST `/internal/insights/extract` - Extract insights

### Priority 3 (Week 3)
- POST `/internal/analysis/sentiment` - Sentiment analysis chain

---

## LangSmith Dashboard

All LLM calls are automatically traced to LangSmith:
- View traces at: https://smith.langchain.com
- Project name: Configured via `LANGSMITH_PROJECT`
- Traces include: latency, tokens, cost, inputs/outputs

### What Gets Traced

1. **avatar_response** - Main avatar generation
2. **extract_insights** - Insight extraction from messages
3. **search_similar_insights** - Vector similarity search
4. **add_insight** - Adding insights to memory

